Third-party components
----------------------

None. Daily Doodle has no third-party dependency and no CDN.

Vendored from this project's own kits (same licence, same author), copied verbatim on 26/11/2026:

- web-kit 0.1.0 — docs/play/web-kit.js — the offline shell, storage helpers and PWA registration
- export-kit 1.0.0 — docs/play/export-kit.js — Blob download, used for the book export

Neither kit is modified. Neither makes a network request.

No ranking
----------

There is no score, vote, rating, rank or gallery order in this app, and the share card carries none. The
spec forbids ranking the drawings and the engine has no shape for it.

A doodle is a list of strokes
------------------------------

The drawing is stored as strokes (arrays of points), not as an image. That keeps a book of doodles small,
and it means the "drawing" is reproducible rather than a picture of a drawing.

No global reveal
----------------

There is no server, so there is no global reveal and no account. The prompt is derived from the date, so
every copy of the app shows the same prompt on the same day without talking to anything.
